      <aside class="card reveal" id="side">
        <h3>Need help choosing?</h3>
        <p class="muted">If you’re unsure which intake fits, choose the Short intake. We will assess and may recommend a deeper session if helpful.</p>

        <h4 style="margin-top:14px">Popular option</h4>
        <div class="muted">Deep intake is suited to multi-domain concerns (sleep, digestion, mood patterning). Short is for single-focus clarity.</div>

        <hr style="margin:14px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05)" />
        <div class="muted">Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3>Quick policies</h3>
      <ul class="muted">
        <li>Cancellation: Please give 48 hours notice to avoid a fee.</li>
        <li>Fees: Payment details will be shared when scheduling; we accept direct payment and provide superbills.</li>
